.TH MATRISAVER 1 "2026-10-23" "matrisaver @VERSION@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
matrisaver \- Matrix-inspired digital rain screensaver
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B matrisaver
.RI [ MODE ]
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B matrisaver
renders the Matrix code cascade in native Rust on wgpu.
.PP
In playback mode it spans every monitor with one continuous scene: the
cascade is rendered once at the union bounding box of all outputs, and
each per-output window presents its own slice of that scene. Columns
therefore do not restart at a bezel. A Wayland surface belongs to a
single output and cannot span, which is why the host creates one window
per output rather than one spanning window.
.PP
.B matrisaver
is a screensaver, not a screen locker. It does not authenticate and does
not secure the session; locking remains the desktop's responsibility.
.SH MODES
.TP
.B \-\-run
Fullscreen playback on every participating output. The default.
.TP
.B \-\-window
Run in a single ordinary window.
.TP
.BI \-\-benchmark\-frames " N"
Headless: advance the runtime
.I N
frames, print a
.B PERF
line, exit. The only mode that needs no compositor.
.TP
.B \-\-list\-adapters
List the GPU adapters wgpu can enumerate, then exit.
.TP
.B \-\-list\-monitors
List the outputs the compositor reports, then exit.
.TP
.B \-h ", " \-\-help
Print usage and exit.
.SH PLAYBACK OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-variant " KEY"
One of
.BR original ", " reloaded ", " revolutions ", " resurrections ", " bane .
.TP
.BI \-\-pipeline " KEY"
Override the variant's pipeline.
.TP
.BI \-\-glow\-quality " Q"
.BR low ", " balanced " or " high .
.TP
.B \-\-overlay ", " \-\-no\-overlay
Force the ASCII silhouette overlay on or off.
.TP
.B \-\-multi\-monitor ", " \-\-single\-monitor
Span every output with one scene (default), or use the primary only.
.TP
.BI \-\-char\-size " N"
Glyph cell size in pixels.
.TP
.B \-\-show\-cursor
Leave the pointer visible during playback.
.TP
.BI \-\-settings " PATH"
Load settings.json from
.I PATH
instead of the XDG config location.
.SH GPU SELECTION
.TP
.BI \-\-wgpu\-backend " LIST"
Comma-separated backend names, e.g.
.BR vulkan,gl .
An explicit request is never silently overridden.
.TP
.BI \-\-wgpu\-adapter\-name " S"
Substring match against the adapter name.
.SH DIAGNOSTICS
Playback writes one-line records to standard error:
.B SESSION
(detected session type),
.B SCENE
(scene size and output count),
.B SURFACE
(which fallback rung succeeded, and the adapter),
.B PRESENT_CHOICE
(variant, pipeline, window count) and
.B FALLBACK
(one per demotion, with a reason). Quote these in a bug report.
.TP
.BI \-\-lifecycle\-frames " N"
Exit after
.I N
rendered frames. Intended for soak tests.
.TP
.BI \-\-lifecycle\-trace " PATH"
Append per-frame
.B LIFECYCLE
records to
.IR PATH .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/matrisaver/settings.json
Settings, shared with the other hosts.
.TP
.I /usr/share/matrisaver/overlays
Overlay image pack installed by this package. A per-user pack in
.I $XDG_DATA_HOME/matrisaver/overlays
takes precedence.
.TP
.I /usr/share/matrisaver/integration
Idle-daemon examples for swayidle, xautolock and xss-lock.
.TP
.I /usr/libexec/matrisaver/matrisaver-idle
Idle-launch wrapper used by the
.B matrisaver-idle.service
user unit.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B MATRISAVER_FORCE_SESSION
.BR wayland ", " x11 " or " headless .
Overrides session detection.
.TP
.B MATRISAVER_OVERLAY_DIR
Overlay image directory override.
.TP
.B WGPU_BACKEND ", " WGPU_ADAPTER_NAME
Equivalent to the GPU selection flags.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Clean exit, including playback dismissed by the user.
.TP
.B 1
Runtime failure after startup.
.TP
.B 2
Bad usage: unknown flag or unparseable value.
.TP
.B 3
No usable GPU adapter on any backend.
.TP
.B 4
Playback requested with no display session reachable.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR swayidle (1),
.BR xautolock (1),
.BR xss-lock (1)
.SH AUTHOR
ophiocus. Source and issues: https://github.com/ophiocus/matrisaver
